# Sensitive Personal Data & Prompts Folder (DO NOT COMMIT TO PUBLIC GITHUB)
/information/
information/
agent
agent/
*.private.*
*sensitive*

# Debug & System Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# OS & Filesystem Metadata
